## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Stop idle schedulers from busy-waiting, so the VM does not
## use CPU when it has no work (useful on shared or small hosts)
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
